flowchart LR
  keeper[Keeper pages] --> action[keeper.* action: guard + re-check]
  action --> fn[moderation function]
  fn --> tx[one transaction over the WebSocket Pool]
  tx --> change[(messages: approve, remove, restore)]
  tx --> audit[(admin_actions)]
  fn --> purge[purge: type the crew number]
  settings[(settings, cached 60 s)] --> board[posting and report limits]
